---
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';

const kalpakPortraitSrc = withBase('/images/arsiv/ataturk-kalpakli-portre.jpg');
---

<section class="ataturk-corner" id="ataturk-kosesi" aria-labelledby="ataturk-corner-heading">
  <div class="ataturk-corner__glow ataturk-corner__glow--gold" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="ataturk-corner__glow ataturk-corner__glow--crimson" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <article class="ataturk-card reveal">
      <figure class="ataturk-card__media">
        <div class="ataturk-card__frame">
          <img
            src={kalpakPortraitSrc}
            alt="Gazi Mustafa Kemal Atatürk'ün kalpaklı birincil arşiv portresi (c. 1923, ABD Kongre Kütüphanesi George Grantham Bain Cam Negatif Koleksiyonu)"
            width="1201"
            height="1719"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <span class="ataturk-card__frame-badge">CAM NEGATİF ARŞİV KAYDI · LCCN 2014716853</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="ataturk-card__caption">
          <strong>Gazi Mustafa Kemal Atatürk · Kalpaklı Portre (c. 1923)</strong>
          <span>
            Library of Congress · George Grantham Bain Cam Negatif Koleksiyonu · Kamu Malı Birincil Arşiv Kaydı
          </span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ataturk-card__content">
        <div class="ataturk-card__badges">
          <span class="ataturk-pill ataturk-pill--crimson">
            <span class="ataturk-pill__star" aria-hidden="true">★</span>
            ATATÜRK KÖŞESİ · FİKRÎ MİRAS
          </span>
          <span class="ataturk-pill ataturk-pill--archive">
            VESİKA · HAKİKAT · ELEŞTİREL AKIL
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 id="ataturk-corner-heading" class="ataturk-card__title">
          Tarihi Efsanelerden Değil, Birincil Vesikalardan Okuma İradesi:
          <span>Gazi Mustafa Kemal Atatürk’ün Tarih Metodolojisi</span>
        </h2>

        <blockquote class="ataturk-card__quote">
          <p class="ataturk-card__quote-main">
            «Tarih yazmak, tarih yapmak kadar mühimdir. Yazan yapana sadık kalmazsa değişmeyen hakikat, insanlığı
            şaşırtacak bir mahiyet alır.»
          </p>
          <p class="ataturk-card__quote-sub">
            «Biz daima hakikat arayan ve onu buldukça ve bulduğumuza kani oldukça ifadeye cüret gösteren adamlar
            olmalıyız. Her işten evvel, dikkat ve itina ile seçeceğiniz vesikalara dayanınız.»
          </p>
          <footer>
            <strong>Gazi Mustafa Kemal Atatürk</strong>
            <span>16 Ağustos 1931, Yalova · Türk Tarihi Tetkik Cemiyeti’ne Yönerge Mektubu</span>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="ataturk-card__body">
          <strong>Çapraz Kaynak</strong>’ın karşı cephelerin vekâyinâmelerini yan yana getiren yayın çizgisi,
          Atatürk’ün tarih araştırmalarını hamasetten ve tek taraflı söylencelerden arındıran
          <strong>belge merkezli bilim anlayışından</strong> beslenir:
        </p>

        <div class="ataturk-milestones" role="list">
          <div class="ataturk-milestone" role="listitem">
            <span class="ataturk-milestone__year">1927 · VESİKALAR DİSİPLİNİ</span>
            <p>
              <em>Nutuk</em>’ta bizzat yönettiği Millî Mücadele’yi dahi tek başına hatıraya bırakmamış; her iddiayı
              yüzlerce telgraf ve tutanaktan oluşan <strong>Vesikalar</strong> cildiyle belgelemiştir.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="ataturk-milestone" role="listitem">
            <span class="ataturk-milestone__year">1931 · KANIT VE SÜZGEÇ</span>
            <p>
              Tarihçinin ödevinin kurgu üretmek değil, birincil belgelere ve eleştirel süzgece dayanarak hakikati
              aramak olduğunu kurumsal ilke hâline getirmiştir.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="ataturk-milestone" role="listitem">
            <span class="ataturk-milestone__year">1935 · KAYNAK DİLLERİ</span>
            <p>
              Dil ve Tarih-Coğrafya Fakültesi’nde kurdurduğu filoloji kürsüleriyle geçmişi ikinci el çevirilerden
              değil, <strong>ana kaynak dillerinden</strong> okuma geleneğini başlatmıştır.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ataturk-corner {
    position: relative;
    padding: 4.8rem 0 5.2rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 76px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ataturk-corner__glow {
    position: absolute;
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(84px);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ataturk-corner__glow--gold {
    top: -90px;
    left: 5%;
    width: 460px;
    height: 320px;
    background: rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.12);
  }

  .ataturk-corner__glow--crimson {
    bottom: -110px;
    right: 6%;
    width: 460px;
    height: 310px;
    background: rgba(217, 72, 95, 0.13);
  }

  .ataturk-card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr);
    gap: 2.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2.5rem 2.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(24, 19, 25, 0.92) 0%, rgba(15, 18, 27, 0.96) 54%, rgba(19, 22, 31, 0.97) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.34);
    box-shadow:
      0 26px 68px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.58),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .ataturk-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    padding: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.52), rgba(217, 72, 95, 0.42), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04));
    -webkit-mask:
      linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,
      linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
    mask-composite: exclude;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ataturk-card__media {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ataturk-card__frame {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1201 / 1719;
    background: #0b0d13;
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.38);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 46px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62);
  }

  .ataturk-card__frame::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%, transparent 56%, rgba(8, 9, 13, 0.44) 100%),
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8, 9, 13, 0.58) 0%, transparent 24%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ataturk-card__frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 18%;
    filter: sepia(0.14) contrast(1.06) brightness(0.96);
    transition: transform 0.55s ease, filter 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ataturk-card:hover .ataturk-card__frame img {
    transform: scale(1.018);
    filter: sepia(0.09) contrast(1.08) brightness(0.99);
  }

  .ataturk-card__frame-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0.78rem;
    left: 0.78rem;
    right: 0.78rem;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(9, 10, 15, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.38);
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ataturk-card__caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding-inline: 0.18rem;
  }

  .ataturk-card__caption strong {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .ataturk-card__caption span {
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    line-height: 1.48;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .ataturk-card__badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ataturk-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.34rem 0.78rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.71rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ataturk-pill--crimson {
    background: rgba(217, 72, 95, 0.17);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 72, 95, 0.45);
    color: #ffa2b0;
  }

  .ataturk-pill__star {
    color: #f5c27a;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .ataturk-pill--archive {
    background: rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.11);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 155, 78, 0.32);
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .ataturk-card__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.65vw, 2.42rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .ataturk-card__title span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.24rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
    background: rgba(9, 11, 16, 0.6);
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote-main {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.14rem, 1.48vw, 1.32rem);
    line-height: 1.46;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote-sub {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.77rem;
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote strong {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .ataturk-card__quote span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .ataturk-card__body {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .ataturk-card__body strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ataturk-milestones {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .ataturk-milestone {
    padding: 0.9rem 0.98rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(11, 14, 21, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .ataturk-milestone__year {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.38rem;
  }

  .ataturk-milestone p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.56;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .ataturk-milestone strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .ataturk-corner {
      padding: 3.4rem 0 3.8rem;
    }

    .ataturk-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.85rem;
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .ataturk-card__media {
      max-width: 360px;
      width: 100%;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .ataturk-milestones {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .ataturk-card {
      padding: 1.4rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .ataturk-pill {
      font-size: 0.61rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.6rem;
    }

    .ataturk-card__frame-badge {
      font-size: 0.56rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 0.24rem 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
